cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TRACE-MAS in your research, please cite as below."
type: software
title: "TRACE-MAS: Securing the Inter-Agent Surface in Multi-Agent LLM Pipelines"
abstract: >
  TRACE-MAS (Tri-vector Resilient Algorithm for Cooperative Embodied Multi-Agent Security)
  is a unified theoretical framework that closes four structural security gaps on the
  inter-agent surface of multi-agent LLM pipelines: cascading alignment drift, identity
  spoofing, cross-agent prompt injection, and temporal adversarial attacks.
authors:
